From 05e9367ce73f29c72cb62e887885bc8f5d5691d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 02:30:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(verify): later setups judge rapids and entries
 against the carried body

When a setup is entered with a body carried from earlier setups, the
job's stock becomes the box enclosing the declared stock and the
carried body wherever that body stands outside the declared stock, so
the rapid, entry, reach and linking laws never see less material than
is really there. The mismatch rides the path as a named note. Declared
material past the carried block is judged present: neither verify's
prior nor the rest mask is read there. A carry the lattice refuses
refuses every op of the setup, and a posed op there digests the rest
chain.

Fixes #319

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
